---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---

<Layout title={t('nav.about')}>
 <div class="bg-[var(--color-tc-cream)] py-24 sm:py-32">
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
 <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-tc-blue)] sm:text-4xl">{t('nav.about')}</h2>
 <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)]/80 ">
 Transmission Circulaire est une structure ancrée dans la transmission intergénérationnelle, de la paix et du partage des valeurs et de la culture.
 </p>
 </div>
 
 <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl sm:mt-20 lg:mt-24 lg:max-w-none">
 <dl class="grid max-w-xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
 <div class="flex flex-col">
 <dt class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)] ">
 <div class="text-[var(--color-tc-blue)] h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-tc-cream)] border border-[var(--color-tc-blue)]/20">
 <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-[var(--color-tc-cream)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21v-8.25M15.75 21v-8.25M8.25 21v-8.25M3 9l9-6 9 6m-1.5 12V10.332A48.315 48.315 0 0012 9.75c-2.551 0-5.056.2-7.5.582V21M3 21h18M12 6.75h.008v.008H12V6.75z" />
 </svg>
 </div>
 Notre Mission
 </dt>
 <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)]/80 ">
 <p class="flex-auto">Favoriser le dialogue entre les générations et promouvoir la culture comme vecteur de paix et d'enrichissement mutuel.</p>
 </dd>
 </div>
 
 <div class="flex flex-col">
 <dt class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)] ">
 <div class="h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-tc-olive)]">
 <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-[var(--color-tc-cream)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 002.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 004.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 00-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 018.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0111.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 11-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 015.25 0z" />
 </svg>
 </div>
 Notre Public
 </dt>
 <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)]/80 ">
 <p class="flex-auto">Nous nous adressons aux jeunes, à nos adhérents, bénévoles, donateurs et au grand public soucieux des enjeux de transmission.</p>
 </dd>
 </div>
 
 <div class="flex flex-col">
 <dt class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)] ">
 <div class="h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--color-tc-red)]">
 <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-[var(--color-tc-cream)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" />
 </svg>
 </div>
 Notre Histoire
 </dt>
 <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-[var(--color-tc-blue)]/80 ">
 <p class="flex-auto">Fondée le 10 juin 2026, l'association s'est rapidement développée autour de projets éditoriaux et d'événements fédérateurs.</p>
 </dd>
 </div>
 </dl>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</Layout>
